# setCursorImage/setCursorState go to the core's cursor plane (moves coalesced to the vblank thread).  K4: every
# successful setDisplayMode is saved as NVRAM xegfx-disp-bootmode; at start the adapter adopts the core's boot state
# (getTiming(XEGFX_KMS_BOOT_STATE_INDEX)) and reports the matching detailed timing as current, so WindowServer finds
# the panel already in its mode.  Backlight and vblank waits use the new KAPI calls.
# Status: in daily use with 0023/0024.
